  "remarks": "Alexander Rudik is the General Director of LLC “ECOPROM”, a Russian company which manufactures first person view (FPV) unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs) of the Bekas series, including the models Bekas-700, Bekas-2500, Bekas-3500, Bekas-4500 and which holds the right to the “Bekas” trademark. All of these UAVs are used in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine. LLC “ECOPROM” also manufactures special kits for its Bekas series UAVs.",
